"W7f1b\" id=\"W7f1b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e8ecd2d\" id=\"u1e8ecd2d\">🐻</span><span data-lake-id=\"u09188946\" id=\"u09188946\">实践练习</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ue8c66137\" id=\"ue8c66137\"><span data-lake-id=\"u661fc17a\" id=\"u661fc17a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">练习1</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue3d3548c\" id=\"ue3d3548c\">：实现一个字符串拷贝函数 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf386c464\" id=\"uf386c464\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8f9ffde\" id=\"ub8f9ffde\">my_strcpy</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5941668e\" id=\"u5941668e\">，将源字符串 src 复制到目标字符串 dest 中。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20src%5B%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22Hello%20World%5C%22%3B%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E6%BA%90%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%5Cnchar%20dest%5B20%5D%3B%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cnmy_strcpy(dest%2C%20src)%3B%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86src%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%5C%22Hello%20World%5C%22%E6%8B%B7%E8%B4%9D%E5%88%B0dest%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E4%B8%AD%5Cn%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%E6%8B%B7%E8%B4%9D%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3A%20%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20dest)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%BA%94%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%5C%22Hello%20World%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%E6%8E%A2%E7%B4%A2string.h%E5%BA%93%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qf2s8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22v6VB8%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc41a3932\" id=\"uc41a3932\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub599ca73\" id=\"ub599ca73\">练习2：</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua11aeac4\" id=\"ua11aeac4\" style=\"color: #601BDE\">查阅</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub126478a\" id=\"ub126478a\">资料，了解标准库</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue61ace68\" id=\"ue61ace68\"><span data-lake-id=\"u883c9b80\" id=\"u883c9b80\">&lt;string.h&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3b7d5ab2\" id=\"u3b7d5ab2\">中常用函数，并编写测试代码，验证其功能</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22strlen()%20-%20%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%5Cnstrcpy()%20%2F%20strncpy()%20-%20%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E6%8B%B7%E8%B4%9D%5Cnstrcmp()%20%2F%20strncmp()%20-%20%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E6%AF%94%E8%BE%83%5Cnstrchr()%20%2F%20strrchr()%20-%20%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E6%9F%A5%E6%89%BE%5Cnstrcat()%20%2F%20strncat()%20-%20%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bML5h%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9085c158\" id=\"u9085c158\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a90c3ec\" id=\"u6a90c3ec\">示例：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u01086d92\" id=\"u01086d92\"><span data-lake-id=\"u884c4d01\" id=\"u884c4d01\">strlen()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u38b67212\" id=\"u38b67212\"> 验证</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22strlen()%20%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstring.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5